**Key observations:**
- All layers share a consistent shape around core fields: name/uid, content, visibility, creator, timestamps
- The SQL layer uses simple types (TEXT, BIGINT, INTEGER) with a JSON payload field
- The Go store layer adds type safety with custom types (Visibility enum, RowStatus)
